## Testing the trigger

A skill that does not load is a policy that is not applied. Before merging a new or changed skill,
ask Claude to do the task **three different ways** — a terse command, a natural sentence, and an
indirect request that implies the task — and confirm the skill loads each time (the `description`
in the frontmatter is what the router matches; tune it, not the body, when a phrasing misses).
Record the three phrasings in the PR.

